There's writing, engraving, and burning, all with the E command.
Writing is fragile and prone to error, 10 letters per move.  Engraving
is one letter per move (writing speed with an athame)  Engraving is
semi-permanent but you don't stop if attacked until you are done with
all the letters.  Burning can be done with a wand of fire or lightning
(lightning will blind you) at writing speed and is permanent.



